sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as ReservationSweeperService (30 s)
  participant H as ReleaseExpiredReservationsHandler
  participant R as Redis
  participant DB as inventory_db
  W->>H: ReleaseExpiredReservationsCommand
  H->>R: TIME (Redis clock) → now
  H->>R: ZRANGEBYSCORE inventory:reservation_expirations -inf now LIMIT 100
  loop each expired reservation key
    H->>R: atomic_release.lua (only while RESERVED, ZREM)
    alt 1 RELEASED
      H->>DB: ledger EXPIRED_RELEASE + reserved − q
    else 0 not found / committed
      H->>H: skip (another instance or a commit won)
    end
  end
